    While nsParseNewMailState itself is still an nsMsgLineBuffer, using the same custom memory management as nsByteArray, at least m_headers can easily be a mozilla::Vector<char> as it seems.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D232987

